{"4410360":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"HOLD MY WHEEL","steam_appid":4410360,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5010800],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your idiot twin brothers need to visit grandma - never mind that the apocalypse hit the world ages ago. Your only home is the bus: grandma lovingly put collars on you all so you'd always stay together with your brothers and never leave the bus, because it can get dangerous out there.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wasteland to Paradise<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross the scenic wastes with your dudes. Traditional roads are gone - forge your own path.   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4410360\/extras\/6836c18df06fefa30a946e7992620a9c.poster.avif?t=1793734052\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4410360\/extras\/6836c18df06fefa30a946e7992620a9c.webm?t=1793734052\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4410360\/extras\/6836c18df06fefa30a946e7992620a9c.mp4?t=1793734052\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Home on Wheels<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your bus is your shelter, your transport, and your last line of defense. Lose it and you're walking through hell.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Friends Change<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay hungry too long and you'll start eyeing your teammates. Get bitten by a zombie or hit by radiation and you turn into one yourself. The squad you started with isn't the one you'll finish with.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4410360\/extras\/6649ffc8aeb16d52e462962add48b8b7.poster.avif?t=1793734052\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4410360\/extras\/6649ffc8aeb16d52e462962add48b8b7.webm?t=1793734052\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4410360\/extras\/6649ffc8aeb16d52e462962add48b8b7.mp4?t=1793734052\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span> <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Magnetic Gun<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a unique magnetic gun to lift, flip, and throw your bus anywhere. Just try not to wreck it - it's your only home.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4410360\/extras\/3418240581f77c4b86dac8ebef12c965.poster.avif?t=1793734052\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4410360\/extras\/3418240581f77c4b86dac8ebef12c965.webm?t=1793734052\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4410360\/extras\/3418240581f77c4b86dac8ebef12c965.mp4?t=1793734052\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span> <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Scrap Cannon<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your bus comes armed. It fires whatever junk you load into it — bottles, cans, scrap. Aim at zombies. Or teammates.<br>  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4410360\/extras\/f07d2e57e29ea322c2771d1275814a7e.poster.avif?t=1793734052\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4410360\/extras\/f07d2e57e29ea322c2771d1275814a7e.webm?t=1793734052\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4410360\/extras\/f07d2e57e29ea322c2771d1275814a7e.mp4?t=1793734052\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span> <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Death is Not the End<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waiting to respawn sucks. Instead, you can become a ghost, a zombie, or a floppy ragdoll. Keep playing with unique perks and limitations until a Hell-Kitty helps you regain your human form.  <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Junkyard Paradise<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bottles, cans, scrap — anything you find becomes ammo for the Scrap Cannon. Got a battery? Use it to patch up the bus <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5-player co-op bus management<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roof-mounted Scrap Cannon<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magnetic gun: lift, flip, throw the bus<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bridge highways from scrap<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playable Ghost \/ Zombie \/ Ragdoll \/ Hungry states<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice chat &amp; Online Co-op<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ice-cold Atomic Cola and Green Burger<\/strong><\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your idiot twin brothers need to visit grandma - never mind that the apocalypse hit the world ages ago. Your only home is the bus: grandma lovingly put collars on you all so you'd always stay together with your brothers and never leave the bus, because it can get dangerous out there.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wasteland to Paradise<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross the scenic wastes with your dudes. Traditional roads are gone - forge your own path.   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4410360\/extras\/6836c18df06fefa30a946e7992620a9c.poster.avif?t=1793734052\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4410360\/extras\/6836c18df06fefa30a946e7992620a9c.webm?t=1793734052\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4410360\/extras\/6836c18df06fefa30a946e7992620a9c.mp4?t=1793734052\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Home on Wheels<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your bus is your shelter, your transport, and your last line of defense. Lose it and you're walking through hell.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Friends Change<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay hungry too long and you'll start eyeing your teammates. Get bitten by a zombie or hit by radiation and you turn into one yourself. The squad you started with isn't the one you'll finish with.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4410360\/extras\/6649ffc8aeb16d52e462962add48b8b7.poster.avif?t=1793734052\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4410360\/extras\/6649ffc8aeb16d52e462962add48b8b7.webm?t=1793734052\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4410360\/extras\/6649ffc8aeb16d52e462962add48b8b7.mp4?t=1793734052\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span> <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Magnetic Gun<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a unique magnetic gun to lift, flip, and throw your bus anywhere. Just try not to wreck it - it's your only home.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4410360\/extras\/3418240581f77c4b86dac8ebef12c965.poster.avif?t=1793734052\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4410360\/extras\/3418240581f77c4b86dac8ebef12c965.webm?t=1793734052\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4410360\/extras\/3418240581f77c4b86dac8ebef12c965.mp4?t=1793734052\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span> <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Scrap Cannon<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your bus comes armed. It fires whatever junk you load into it — bottles, cans, scrap. Aim at zombies. Or teammates.<br>  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4410360\/extras\/f07d2e57e29ea322c2771d1275814a7e.poster.avif?t=1793734052\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4410360\/extras\/f07d2e57e29ea322c2771d1275814a7e.webm?t=1793734052\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4410360\/extras\/f07d2e57e29ea322c2771d1275814a7e.mp4?t=1793734052\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span> <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Death is Not the End<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waiting to respawn sucks. Instead, you can become a ghost, a zombie, or a floppy ragdoll. Keep playing with unique perks and limitations until a Hell-Kitty helps you regain your human form.  <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Junkyard Paradise<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bottles, cans, scrap — anything you find becomes ammo for the Scrap Cannon. Got a battery? Use it to patch up the bus <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5-player co-op bus management<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roof-mounted Scrap Cannon<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magnetic gun: lift, flip, throw the bus<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bridge highways from scrap<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playable Ghost \/ Zombie \/ Ragdoll \/ Hungry states<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice chat &amp; Online Co-op<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ice-cold Atomic Cola and Green Burger<\/strong><\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"You need to visit grandma - twin brothers, apocalypse, and all. Keep the bus running, and try not to eat your friends when the hunger hits.","supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Polish, Russian, Turkish, Ukrainian, Swedish, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Japanese","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4410360\/57ee8eba4058a019d1dd2346d67c87b9f7ac9e5e\/header.jpg?t=1793734052","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4410360\/0c790d190e4fd4daba27de4f9e745ceb767ba042\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793734052","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4410360\/0c790d190e4fd4daba27de4f9e745ceb767ba042\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793734052","website":"https:\/\/tessermind.com\/games\/hold-my-wheel\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> WINDOWS 10, 11 (64-BIT)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 10<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 5 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> WINDOWS 10, 11 (64-BIT)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i7, AMD FX-9590 or better<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 3060<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 5 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"legal_notice":"© 2026 TESSERMIND. HOLD MY WHEEL and the HOLD MY WHEEL logo are trademarks of TESSERMIND. All rights reserved.","developers":["Tessermind"],"publishers":["Tessermind"],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":799,"final":559,"discount_percent":30,"initial_formatted":"$7.99","final_formatted":"$5.59"},"packages":[1540240],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy HOLD MY WHEEL","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1540240,"percent_savings_text":"-30% ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"HOLD MY WHEEL - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$7.99<\/span> $5.59","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":559}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":1,"description":"Multi-player"},{"id":9,"description":"Co-op"},{"id":38,"description":"Online Co-op"},{"id":68,"description":"Custom Volume Controls"},{"id":80,"description":"#category_playable_at_your_own_pace"},{"id":74,"description":"Playable without Timed Input"},{"id":69,"description":"Stereo Sound"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"1","description":"Action"},{"id":"25","description":"Adventure"},{"id":"4","description":"Casual"},{"id":"23","description":"Indie"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4410360\/133d7e050beac77f8971a9868b2fd1461c51c6d6\/ss_133d7e050beac77f8971a9868b2fd1461c51c6d6.600x338.jpg?t=1793734052","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4410360\/133d7e050beac77f8971a9868b2fd1461c51c6d6\/ss_133d7e050beac77f8971a9868b2fd1461c51c6d6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793734052"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4410360\/b040e1f82c83b397953b7932ee000676cd906245\/ss_b040e1f82c83b397953b7932ee000676cd906245.600x338.jpg?t=1793734052","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4410360\/b040e1f82c83b397953b7932ee000676cd906245\/ss_b040e1f82c83b397953b7932ee000676cd906245.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793734052"},{"id":2,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4410360\/90c0bf1e57e6eb661b9d0e8c8e7a057572d25891\/ss_90c0bf1e57e6eb661b9d0e8c8e7a057572d25891.600x338.jpg?t=1793734052","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4410360\/90c0bf1e57e6eb661b9d0e8c8e7a057572d25891\/ss_90c0bf1e57e6eb661b9d0e8c8e7a057572d25891.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793734052"},{"id":3,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4410360\/d549608e552817927750fe400c8ebbd7ee09e115\/ss_d549608e552817927750fe400c8ebbd7ee09e115.600x338.jpg?t=1793734052","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4410360\/d549608e552817927750fe400c8ebbd7ee09e115\/ss_d549608e552817927750fe400c8ebbd7ee09e115.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793734052"},{"id":4,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4410360\/f38978829222d29230cd64101502bb26b3fc5f41\/ss_f38978829222d29230cd64101502bb26b3fc5f41.600x338.jpg?t=1793734052","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4410360\/f38978829222d29230cd64101502bb26b3fc5f41\/ss_f38978829222d29230cd64101502bb26b3fc5f41.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793734052"},{"id":5,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4410360\/6e6f969bc834bea8fff8a9c1f3b9e7ed70572ea6\/ss_6e6f969bc834bea8fff8a9c1f3b9e7ed70572ea6.600x338.jpg?t=1793734052","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4410360\/6e6f969bc834bea8fff8a9c1f3b9e7ed70572ea6\/ss_6e6f969bc834bea8fff8a9c1f3b9e7ed70572ea6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793734052"},{"id":6,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4410360\/469d773a89fdfa2c50bbbbd1de55b38cf6f86699\/ss_469d773a89fdfa2c50bbbbd1de55b38cf6f86699.600x338.jpg?t=1793734052","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4410360\/469d773a89fdfa2c50bbbbd1de55b38cf6f86699\/ss_469d773a89fdfa2c50bbbbd1de55b38cf6f86699.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793734052"},{"id":7,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4410360\/664f8f10b1a6a78735f2ad58e7f6d3dde5a6f233\/ss_664f8f10b1a6a78735f2ad58e7f6d3dde5a6f233.600x338.jpg?t=1793734052","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4410360\/664f8f10b1a6a78735f2ad58e7f6d3dde5a6f233\/ss_664f8f10b1a6a78735f2ad58e7f6d3dde5a6f233.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793734052"},{"id":8,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4410360\/225e1f98639a106465471e4e7702bdb3ff241524\/ss_225e1f98639a106465471e4e7702bdb3ff241524.600x338.jpg?t=1793734052","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4410360\/225e1f98639a106465471e4e7702bdb3ff241524\/ss_225e1f98639a106465471e4e7702bdb3ff241524.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793734052"},{"id":9,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4410360\/b662e7cc5037cebedb3facaa0cfcccb64a5d3ac7\/ss_b662e7cc5037cebedb3facaa0cfcccb64a5d3ac7.600x338.jpg?t=1793734052","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4410360\/b662e7cc5037cebedb3facaa0cfcccb64a5d3ac7\/ss_b662e7cc5037cebedb3facaa0cfcccb64a5d3ac7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793734052"}],"movies":[{"id":257400608,"name":"HOLD MY WHEEL - Gameplay","thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/257400608\/4d84da8f18b07c8fe64e3412b908eca67fbdfea3\/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1786878515","dash_av1":"https:\/\/video.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_trailers\/4410360\/341116408\/67eb599fbf3b27f8037d509f80673977608b97af\/1786873290\/dash_av1.mpd?t=1786878515","dash_h264":"https:\/\/video.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_trailers\/4410360\/341116408\/67eb599fbf3b27f8037d509f80673977608b97af\/1786873290\/dash_h264.mpd?t=1786878515","hls_h264":"https:\/\/video.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_trailers\/4410360\/341116408\/67eb599fbf3b27f8037d509f80673977608b97af\/1786873290\/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1786878515","highlight":true},{"id":257322370,"name":"HOLD MY WHEEL - Gameplay teaser","thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/257322370\/b20560b598327cac13bbb02afedeb63c852f09f1\/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1786878516","dash_av1":"https:\/\/video.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_trailers\/4410360\/101267230\/0d19329817af9230c2fd9301b5708b225101ff63\/1776620500\/dash_av1.mpd?t=1786878516","dash_h264":"https:\/\/video.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_trailers\/4410360\/101267230\/0d19329817af9230c2fd9301b5708b225101ff63\/1776620500\/dash_h264.mpd?t=1786878516","hls_h264":"https:\/\/video.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_trailers\/4410360\/101267230\/0d19329817af9230c2fd9301b5708b225101ff63\/1776620500\/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1